      "lines": [
        "问题和习题*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1° 1) 说出你所知道的几何图形．",
        "2) 说出具有下列形状的物体：а) 长方体；б) 球；в)",
        "圆柱．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 求作以已知点$O$为中心、半径为$4\\mathrm{cm}$的圆周．在作出的",
        "图上（不用圆规和刻度尺）标出：",
        "1) 点$A$、$B$、$C$，且$|OA|<4\\mathrm{cm}$，$|OB|<4\\mathrm{cm}$，$|OC|<$",
        "$4\\mathrm{cm}$；",
        "2) 点$D$、$E$、$F$，且$|OD|=4\\mathrm{cm}$，$|OE|=4\\mathrm{cm}$，$|OF|=$",
        "$4\\mathrm{cm}$；",
        "3) 点$L$、$M$、$N$，且$|OL|>4\\mathrm{cm}$，$|OM|>4\\mathrm{cm}$，$|ON|>$",
        "$4\\mathrm{cm}$；",
        "4) 用符号$\\in$和$\\notin$写出：а) 点$A$不属于圆周$(O,r)$；б)",
        "点$D$属于圆周$(O,r)$；в) 点$L$不属于圆周$(O,r)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3° 1) 圆周的中心属于圆周吗？",
        "2) 圆心属于圆吗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4. 利用符号$\\in$和$\\notin$表示图4上标出的各点是否属于已",
        "知圆．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "5",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5. 已知点$A$、$B$和$C$．就图形1) $\\{A,B\\}$和2) $\\{A,B,C\\}$，",
        "分别写出它们所包含的各个几何图形．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "6",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "6. 作半径为$3\\mathrm{cm}$的圆周．在这个圆周上可以找到满足下",
        "列条件的点$M$和$N$吗？"
      ]
    },
